{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.poster.avif?t=1741603047\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.webm?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.mp4?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status \u2013 Important Note:</strong><br><i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> was originally planned to be a full single-player adventure <strong>with both story-driven content and a wave shooter mode</strong>. However, <strong>development has been discontinued</strong>, and the game remains in its current form\u2014a <strong>wave-based shooter</strong> designed to test core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than keep <i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> in Early Access forever, I wanted to be transparent and officially close this chapter. I did not reach my original goal of developing a full <strong>single-player campaign alongside the wave shooter mode</strong>. However, as some players requested, I\u2019ve kept the finished aspects of the game available for those who want to explore them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported this project\u2014hopefully, we\u2019ll see you for the next adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR: Under a Desert Sun</strong> places you in the heart of a classic pulp adventure, reminiscent of the action-packed stories from old movies. Step into the role of a reluctant hero in World War II, battling against ruthless Nazi forces and an ancient magical power that has awakened from the desert sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR experience features <strong>realistic weapon handling and immersive environmental interactions</strong>, bringing the adventure to life in a way only virtual reality can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game will not receive further updates, this <strong>horde mode remains fully playable</strong>, offering an arcade-style VR shooting experience in a pulpy, action-packed setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is there?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapon handling:</strong> use your controllers to handle realistic world war 2 weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight:</strong> use your flying skills to fly airplanes and avoid death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free movement and exploration:</strong> explore large environments any way you want.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impressive VR Graphics:</strong> feel immersed in the desert while being overwhelmed by the desert hordes. Incredibly detailed environments, weapons and enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR only:</strong> this game has been built from the ground up for VR. All interactions and mechanics were built to experience in VR.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Join us on discord:   to give feedback, post bugs or just have a general chat about Under a Desert Sun!</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/587930?t=1741603047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741603047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741603047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741603047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of violence.\r\nThis games contains semi-realistic behaviour of fireweapons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.poster.avif?t=1741603047\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.webm?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.mp4?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status \u2013 Important Note:</strong><br><i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> was originally planned to be a full single-player adventure <strong>with both story-driven content and a wave shooter mode</strong>. However, <strong>development has been discontinued</strong>, and the game remains in its current form\u2014a <strong>wave-based shooter</strong> designed to test core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than keep <i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> in Early Access forever, I wanted to be transparent and officially close this chapter. I did not reach my original goal of developing a full <strong>single-player campaign alongside the wave shooter mode</strong>. However, as some players requested, I\u2019ve kept the finished aspects of the game available for those who want to explore them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported this project\u2014hopefully, we\u2019ll see you for the next adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR: Under a Desert Sun</strong> places you in the heart of a classic pulp adventure, reminiscent of the action-packed stories from old movies. Step into the role of a reluctant hero in World War II, battling against ruthless Nazi forces and an ancient magical power that has awakened from the desert sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR experience features <strong>realistic weapon handling and immersive environmental interactions</strong>, bringing the adventure to life in a way only virtual reality can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game will not receive further updates, this <strong>horde mode remains fully playable</strong>, offering an arcade-style VR shooting experience in a pulpy, action-packed setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is there?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapon handling:</strong> use your controllers to handle realistic world war 2 weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight:</strong> use your flying skills to fly airplanes and avoid death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free movement and exploration:</strong> explore large environments any way you want.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impressive VR Graphics:</strong> feel immersed in the desert while being overwhelmed by the desert hordes. Incredibly detailed environments, weapons and enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR only:</strong> this game has been built from the ground up for VR. All interactions and mechanics were built to experience in VR.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Join us on discord:   to give feedback, post bugs or just have a general chat about Under a Desert Sun!</u></p>","developers":["Revolving Gear Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/header.jpg?t=1741603047","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Twitter</strong><br><br><strong>Youtube</strong><br><br><strong>Discord</strong><br><br><strong>Reddit</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Special Credits</strong><br><i><u>Bow model</u></i><br>This product uses the Bow model as displayed in:<br>Check out their channel for awesome tutorials and information on making Unity VR projects: <br><br><i><u>Camp Fire</u></i><br>This product uses the campfire model by David Stenfors ","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/587930/455199/68beb21df6903cca1aca9353508f5a9c1dc55124/1751107103/dash_av1.mpd?t=1649927750","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/587930/455199/68beb21df6903cca1aca9353508f5a9c1dc55124/1751107103/dash_h264.mpd?t=1649927750","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/587930/455199/68beb21df6903cca1aca9353508f5a9c1dc55124/1751107103/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1649927750","id":256882146,"name":"BulletTimeTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256882146/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1649927750"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/587930/273031/145ed750a8d61bb6733071eff4b8eb2d0d1b9038/1751107102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1584643920","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/587930/273031/145ed